    "body": "Adds a configuration for `mise lsp`, the language server built into mise v2026.10.18 and later. It provides diagnostics, completion, hover, formatting, and task navigation for mise config files.\n\n- [Upstream documentation](https://mise.jdx.dev/ide-integration.html#language-server) includes a Neovim configuration example.\n- [jdx/mise](https://github.com/jdx/mise) has over 35,000 stars, meeting the new-config popularity criterion.\n- The config allows operation without workspace markers so global configs and standalone environment configs work too.\n\nTested on Neovim 0.12.6 with mise 2026.10.19: the server attaches and reports unknown-key diagnostics for `mise.toml`, global `mise/config.toml`, `mise/conf.d/tools.toml`, standalone `mise.dev.toml`, and `.mise/config.toml`. `stylua --check lsp/mise.lua` passes. Full repository lint has not been run.",
